WEBVTT

00:59:29.875 --> 00:59:32.268
And in doing it,

00:59:32.292 --> 00:59:34.684
one of the things that my father said,

00:59:34.708 --> 00:59:37.393
and I know people sometimes
get tired of hearing me say,

00:59:37.417 --> 00:59:38.684
"My father said,"

00:59:38.708 --> 00:59:39.976
but I just think,

00:59:40.000 --> 00:59:42.809
I wish, should I say,
we had really listened to him,

00:59:42.833 --> 00:59:45.143
because we wouldn't be
on this platform right now

00:59:45.167 --> 00:59:47.309
having this type of conversation.

00:59:47.333 --> 00:59:49.934
But he left something with us,
sort of a blueprint

00:59:49.958 --> 00:59:53.476
in "Where Do We Go From Here:
Chaos or Community?",

00:59:53.500 --> 00:59:55.893
his book, and he said,

00:59:55.917 --> 01:00:00.934
going forward, the meddlesome task
is to organize our strength